    "description": "Title\n: Trend Clocks Pipe Rack Humidor With 7 Tobacco Pipes Glass Jar Filters Lot-7x10x6\nBrand\n: Trend Clocks\nColor\n: Brown\nMaterial\n: Wood and glass\nDepartment\n: Collectibles & Art\nCategory\n: Collectibles & Art\nCondition\n: Good - shows some sign of wear\nDescription\n: Enhance your collectibles display or pipe collection with this vintage Trend Clocks wooden pipe rack and glass tobacco humidor. The sturdy wooden frame by Trend Clocks (Holland, Michigan) holds up to 6 pipes and features a glass humidor jar with a secure wooden lid, ideal for keeping pipe tobacco fresh. This listing includes 7assorted estate pipes in various conditions and designs, plus two vintage boxes of pipe filters visible inside the jar. Its classic wood grain and retro design add timeless appeal, making it suitable for both use and decorative display. Each pipe slot is crafted for easy organization, while the center jar keeps your accessories handy. Signs of age and use, such as surface dust and char marks, are visible, but the structure remains durable and well-crafted. A practical and attractive piece for tobacco enthusiasts, estate pipe collectors, or vintage home decor lovers\nThis is a pre-owned item donated to Goodwill of Northern Michigan.\nPlease see images for further detail and ask any questions you may have before making a bid.\nItems have been tested for power, not function. In some instances we may not have the necessary equipment to test certain electronics therefore all items will be auctioned off AS-IS with no refunds.\nItems in lots are sold as-is, are not eligible for refunds, and may not be individually wrapped.\nPlease contact us before making payment to review combined shipping options.\nPick-Ups\nWe're open Monday - Friday, 8 am - 4 pm. We are closed on weekends and major holidays. For local pickup in Traverse City, please give us 24 hours from time of payment to prepare your order. Thank you!",
