    "description": "Bendos Action Figure Lot - 7 Pieces\nKid Galaxy, early 2000s Era\nThis collection features seven vintage Bendos action figures in their original retail packaging. Known for their \"Action Figures with a Twist\" tagline, Bendos gained popularity in the late 1990s and early 2000s for their flexible, wire-framed bodies that allowed for infinite posing. This lot represents a diverse cross-section of the line, including sports, classic monsters, and unique character themes, making it an excellent addition for collectors of early millennial toys.\nFigures Included:\nHockey Goalie - Blue and yellow uniform with goalie mask and stick, in rectangular box\nSports Referee - Black and white striped jersey with oversized yellow whistle, in rectangular box\nFrankenstein Monster - Green-skinned figure with classic flat-top hair and chain accessory, in tube packaging\nCaveman - Figure wearing a brown faux-fur style outfit, in tube packaging\nSkydiver/Pilot - Yellow and purple suit with goggles, in tube packaging\nMedical X-Ray Figure - Character with a skeleton/medical chart overlay, in tube packaging\nBumblebee - Character in yellow and black striped outfit, housed in a unique clear display sphere\nCondition:\nAll figures remain factory sealed in their original packaging. The rectangular boxes show light shelf wear including minor corner softening and slight creasing to the cardboard. The clear plastic tubes and sphere are intact with no major cracks, though some light surface scuffing from storage is present. The internal figures appear pristine with vibrant paint and no visible degradation of the flexible material.\nPayment Extensions -\nDue to demand, we will no longer extend any payment deadlines.\nAuthenticated Items Returns & Refund Disclaimer -\nRefunds and returns must be inquired on within 7 days of receipt of item(s). Returns on authenticated items will be refunded the amount paid for the item (excluding shipping and handling) less a restocking fee.\n